# Legibility Office Datasets

This directory contains sample datasets supporting the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

These datasets are intended for:

- Research
- Demonstrations
- AI development
- Dashboards
- Public sector analytics
- Institutional benchmarking

## Available Datasets

- Governance Indicators
- Procurement Indicators
- Institutional Capability Index
- Digital Public Infrastructure Index
- AI Governance Maturity
- Procurement Risk Register
- Institutional Memory Metrics
- Interoperability Index
- National Competitiveness Index
- Public Sector AI Indicators

All datasets are illustrative and released under the Apache 2.0 License unless otherwise specified.
